remarks.code:
public override void UseSharedInterface(IInterfaceManager interfaces)
{
    _console = interfaces.TryGetSharedInterface<IPlatformConsole>(PlatformCoreCapabilities.PlatformConsoleName, out var c) ? c : null;
}
// next to Core.Logger.LogInformation(...):
_console?.Write("csroll", "info", "Perk config reloaded: 42 perks");

member.summary:
Keeps one line.  = the plugin's slug as in the presence report (surf, csroll;
lowercase letters, digits, '-'; core is PlatformCore's own).  = debug,
info, warn or error (others count as info). Text longer than 1000 characters is cut.

remarks.code:
public override void UseSharedInterface(IInterfaceManager interfaces)
{
    interfaces.TryGetSharedInterface<IPlatformEvents>(PlatformCoreCapabilities.PlatformEventsName, out _platform);
    _platform?.SetMode("retake");
}
